 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I keep going dizzy when I stand up."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When did you first notice the dizziness when you stand up?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Started about ten days ago."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you ever had an allergic reaction or a bad reaction to any medicine?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, never had a problem with medicines."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How much does the dizziness when you stand up affect your daily activities?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've stopped going to my lunch club, dear."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Has anything changed with your medicines recently, like a new one or a different dose?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Yes, I started a new blood-pressure tablet."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, never had an operation."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How bad is the dizziness when you stand up? Would you say it's mild, moderate, or severe, or you're not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "About six out of ten. I nearly fell once."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When that dizzy feeling comes on, where in your body do you feel it most?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It's a swimmy, faint feeling in my head."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’ve noticed along with the dizziness that you’d like to mention?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No chest pain or anything like that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What worries you most about the dizziness?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I think the new tablet's causing it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’d like to add about your past health?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've had high blood pressure for years."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you'd like to add about what you notice when you feel dizzy?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My daughter comes round every Tuesday, she does my shopping."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Other than your high blood pressure, is there anything else about your past health you'd like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've got arthritis in both my hips."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’ve noticed when you feel dizzy standing up?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It settles if I sit back down a minute."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Are you taking any medicines at the moment: yes, either regularly or ones you've started or changed recently; no; or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Yes, a water tablet each morning."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
